    },
    "message": "Serve water and meals on the generated Scenario in the resource service test\n\nThe test ran on h00_small_replay with a water station and meal point added by\nhand, so a person never walked to a service point. On the shared generated\nScenario the person walks from the sleeping area through the corridor, or only\ninside the station's area when placed there, and a worker with the station's\nskill serves them. Need relief and amounts are read from the Scenario's\nresource_service config, with A002's unchanged growth as the comparison.\n\nPart of #137.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
